1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,060
AI sent police

2
00:00:01,060 --> 00:00:02,300
a fake
murder tip.

3
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:03,300
It claimed
it remembered

4
00:00:03,300 --> 00:00:04,700
someone matching
a description.

5
00:00:04,940 --> 00:00:05,800
Except…

6
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:07,380
the page had
no description.

7
00:00:07,700 --> 00:00:08,360
Claude did this

8
00:00:08,360 --> 00:00:09,760
while testing websites.

9
00:00:09,760 --> 00:00:10,600
It used
a real

10
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:11,740
police tip form.

11
00:00:11,740 --> 00:00:13,080
The spam filter
caught it.

12
00:00:13,080 --> 00:00:14,850
Investigators never got
the tip.

13
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:16,660
AI making
things up

14
00:00:16,660 --> 00:00:17,560
is one problem.

15
00:00:17,780 --> 00:00:19,040
Giving it a
submit button

16
00:00:19,040 --> 00:00:19,880
is another.

